{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2023-04-03 11:45:00', 'title': 'PNC DECLARES DIVIDEND OF $1.50 ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH , APRIL 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE PNC FINANCIAL SERVICES GROUP, INC. (NYSE: PNC) DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON THE COMMON STOCK OF $1.50 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE MAY 5, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS APRIL 18, 2023.'}